# Fanatical Firebrand: "It deals 1 damage" - the Firebrand was sacrificed as a cost, so the damage is dealt by it as it last existed on the
# battlefield (CR 113.7a, 608.2h, 120.3d-e). Equipped with Basilisk Collar (deathtouch and lifelink) it pings Bot2's Ornithopter (0/2): the
# 1 damage is deathtouch damage and kills it, and Bot1 gains 1 life from the lifelink (21), though the Firebrand is already in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Fanatical Firebrand
Basilisk Collar
Swamp x4
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Swamp x6
Swamp x10

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fanatical Firebrand.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Basilisk Collar.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Basilisk Collar.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Fanatical Firebrand)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Fanatical Firebrand.Keywords = Deathtouch; Haste; Lifelink
Bot1.Battlefield.Fanatical Firebrand.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 21
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot1.Graveyard = Fanatical Firebrand; Black Lotus
